    public function releaseReservation($profileId,$reservationId,$idempotencyKey){$idempotencyKey=CreditRules::idempotency($idempotencyKey);$payload=array("profileId"=>intval($profileId),"reservationId"=>intval($reservationId));return$this->db->transaction(function($db)use($profileId,$reservationId,$idempotencyKey,$payload){$idem=$this->beginIdempotency($db,"release-reservation",$idempotencyKey,$payload);if($idem->replay){$idem->response->idempotentReplay=true;return$idem->response;}$reservation=$db->one("SELECT r.*,w.owner_profile_id,w.posted_balance,w.reserved_balance,w.available_balance,w.balance_version FROM davvag_credit_reservation r JOIN davvag_credit_wallet w ON w.id=r.wallet_id WHERE r.id=? LIMIT 1 FOR UPDATE","i",array(intval($reservationId)));if(!$reservation||intval($reservation->owner_profile_id)!==intval($profileId))throw new CreditException("Reservation was not found.");if($reservation->status!=="ACTIVE")throw new CreditException("Only an active reservation can be released.");$reserved=intval($reservation->reserved_balance)-intval($reservation->amount);$available=intval($reservation->available_balance)+intval($reservation->amount);$db->updateById("davvag_credit_reservation",$reservation->id,array("status"=>"RELEASED","released_at"=>date("Y-m-d H:i:s")));$db->run("UPDATE davvag_credit_wallet SET reserved_balance=?,available_balance=?,balance_version=balance_version+1 WHERE id=?","iii",array($reserved,$available,$reservation->wallet_id));$response=(object)array("reservationId"=>intval($reservation->id),"status"=>"RELEASED","idempotentReplay"=>false,"balance"=>(object)array("posted"=>intval($reservation->posted_balance),"reserved"=>$reserved,"available"=>$available,"version"=>intval($reservation->balance_version)+1));$this->completeIdempotency($db,"release-reservation",$idempotencyKey,0,$response);return$response;});}
    public function hasLessonUnlock($profileId,$lessonId){return$this->db->one("SELECT * FROM davvag_credit_lesson_unlock WHERE profile_id=? AND lesson_id=? LIMIT 1","ii",array(intval($profileId),intval($lessonId)));}
    public function unlockLesson($profileId,$lessonId,$amount,$context=array()){$existing=$this->hasLessonUnlock($profileId,$lessonId);if($existing)return(object)array("alreadyUnlocked"=>true,"unlock"=>$existing,"balance"=>$this->summary($profileId));$defaults=array("programCode"=>"CREDIT","sourceApp"=>"lesson-manager","referenceType"=>"lesson","referenceId"=>strval($lessonId),"idempotencyKey"=>"lesson-access:".intval($profileId).":".intval($lessonId),"description"=>"Unlock lesson #".intval($lessonId));$context=array_merge($defaults,is_object($context)?get_object_vars($context):$context);$result=$this->debit($profileId,$amount,$context,function($db,$tx)use($profileId,$lessonId,$amount){$found=$db->one("SELECT * FROM davvag_credit_lesson_unlock WHERE profile_id=? AND lesson_id=? LIMIT 1 FOR UPDATE","ii",array(intval($profileId),intval($lessonId)));if($found)throw new CreditException("This lesson is already unlocked.");$db->insert("davvag_credit_lesson_unlock",array("profile_id"=>intval($profileId),"lesson_id"=>intval($lessonId),"credit_amount"=>intval($amount),"transaction_id"=>intval($tx->id),"unlocked_at"=>date("Y-m-d H:i:s")));});$result->alreadyUnlocked=false;$result->unlock=$this->hasLessonUnlock($profileId,$lessonId);return$result;}
    public function reverse($transactionId,$context){$original=$this->transactionById($transactionId);if(!$original||$original->status!=="POSTED")throw new CreditException("A posted transaction is required.");if($this->db->one("SELECT id FROM davvag_credit_transaction WHERE original_transaction_id=? AND status='POSTED' LIMIT 1","i",array(intval($transactionId))))throw new CreditException("This transaction has already been reversed.");$direction=null;$amount=0;$profileId=0;foreach($original->entries as$entry){$wallet=$this->db->one("SELECT owner_profile_id,wallet_type FROM davvag_credit_wallet WHERE id=?","i",array(intval($entry->wallet_id)));if(!$wallet||$wallet->wallet_type!=="USER_WALLET")continue;if($profileId>0&&$profileId!==intval($wallet->owner_profile_id))throw new CreditException("A multi-owner transaction requires manual investigation.");if($direction!==null&&$direction!==$entry->direction)throw new CreditException("A mixed-direction user transaction requires manual investigation.");$profileId=intval($wallet->owner_profile_id);$direction=$entry->direction;$amount+=intval($entry->amount);}if($direction===null||$profileId<1||$amount<1)throw new CreditException("The transaction has no reversible user entry.");$context=is_object($context)?get_object_vars($context):$context;$context["referenceType"]="credit-reversal";$context["referenceId"]=strval($transactionId);$context["description"]=isset($context["description"])?$context["description"]:"Reverse transaction #".intval($transactionId);$link=function($db,$tx)use($transactionId){$db->updateById("davvag_credit_transaction",$tx->id,array("original_transaction_id"=>intval($transactionId),"transaction_type"=>"REVERSAL"));};if($direction==="DEBIT")return$this->credit($profileId,$amount,$context,"REFUND",null,false,$link);return$this->debit($profileId,$amount,$context,$link);}
    public function expireDueLots($limit=100){$limit=max(1,min(500,intval($limit)));$lots=$this->db->all("SELECT id FROM davvag_credit_lot WHERE status='ACTIVE' AND remaining_amount>0 AND expires_at IS NOT NULL AND expires_at<=NOW() AND source_type<>'PURCHASE' ORDER BY expires_at,id LIMIT ?","i",array($limit));$expired=array();foreach($lots as$candidate){$result=$this->db->transaction(function($db)use($candidate){$lot=$db->one("SELECT l.*,w.owner_profile_id,w.posted_balance,w.reserved_balance,w.available_balance,w.balance_version,p.code program_code FROM davvag_credit_lot l JOIN davvag_credit_wallet w ON w.id=l.wallet_id JOIN davvag_credit_program p ON p.id=l.program_id WHERE l.id=? LIMIT 1 FOR UPDATE","i",array(intval($candidate->id)));if(!$lot||$lot->status!=="ACTIVE"||intval($lot->remaining_amount)<1||empty($lot->expires_at)||strtotime($lot->expires_at)>time()||$lot->source_type==="PURCHASE")return null;$amount=min(intval($lot->remaining_amount),max(0,intval($lot->available_balance)));if($amount<1)return null;$program=$this->programIn($db,$lot->program_code,true);$system=$this->ensureWalletRow($db,$program,0,"EXPIRATION_CLEARING");$context=array("sourceApp"=>"davvag-credit-points","referenceType"=>"credit-lot","referenceId"=>strval($lot->id),"idempotencyKey"=>"expiration:".$lot->id.":".strtotime($lot->expires_at),"description"=>"Expire promotional credit lot #".$lot->id);$tx=$this->createTransaction($db,$program,"EXPIRATION",$context);$posted=intval($lot->posted_balance)-$amount;$available=intval($lot->available_balance)-$amount;$systemPosted=intval($system->posted_balance)+$amount;$left=intval($lot->remaining_amount)-$amount;$db->updateById("davvag_credit_lot",$lot->id,array("remaining_amount"=>$left,"status"=>$left===0?"EXPIRED":"ACTIVE"));$db->run("UPDATE davvag_credit_wallet SET posted_balance=?,available_balance=?,balance_version=balance_version+1 WHERE id=?","iii",array($posted,$available,$lot->wallet_id));$db->run("UPDATE davvag_credit_wallet SET posted_balance=?,available_balance=?,balance_version=balance_version+1 WHERE id=?","iii",array($systemPosted,intval($system->available_balance)+$amount,$system->id));$db->insert("davvag_credit_entry",array("transaction_id"=>intval($tx->id),"wallet_id"=>intval($lot->wallet_id),"direction"=>"DEBIT","amount"=>$amount,"credit_lot_id"=>intval($lot->id),"balance_after"=>$posted,"description"=>$context["description"]));$db->insert("davvag_credit_entry",array("transaction_id"=>intval($tx->id),"wallet_id"=>intval($system->id),"direction"=>"CREDIT","amount"=>$amount,"credit_lot_id"=>0,"balance_after"=>$systemPosted,"description"=>$context["description"]));return(object)array("lotId"=>intval($lot->id),"transactionId"=>intval($tx->id),"amount"=>$amount,"remaining"=>$left);});if($result)$expired[]=$result;}return(object)array("processed"=>count($expired),"lots"=>$expired);}
    public function history($profileId,$filters=array()){$wallet=$this->wallet($profileId,isset($filters["programCode"])?$filters["programCode"]:"CREDIT");$limit=max(1,min(100,intval(isset($filters["limit"])?$filters["limit"]:25)));$offset=max(0,intval(isset($filters["offset"])?$filters["offset"]:0));$types="i";$params=array($wallet->id);$sql="SELECT t.*,e.direction,e.amount,e.balance_after,e.credit_lot_id FROM davvag_credit_entry e JOIN davvag_credit_transaction t ON t.id=e.transaction_id WHERE e.wallet_id=?";if(!empty($filters["transactionType"])){$sql.=" AND t.transaction_type=?";$types.="s";$params[]=strtoupper($filters["transactionType"]);}$sql.=" ORDER BY t.id DESC LIMIT ? OFFSET ".$offset;$types.="i";$params[]=$limit;return$this->db->all($sql,$types,$params);}
    public function transactionById($transactionId){$transaction=$this->db->one("SELECT * FROM davvag_credit_transaction WHERE id=? LIMIT 1","i",array(intval($transactionId)));if(!$transaction)return null;$transaction->entries=$this->db->all("SELECT * FROM davvag_credit_entry WHERE transaction_id=? ORDER BY id","i",array($transaction->id));return$transaction;}
    public function reconcile($walletId){$wallet=$this->db->one("SELECT * FROM davvag_credit_wallet WHERE id=?","i",array(intval($walletId)));if(!$wallet)throw new CreditException("Wallet was not found.");$posted=$this->db->one("SELECT COALESCE(SUM(CASE WHEN direction='CREDIT' THEN amount ELSE -amount END),0) amount FROM davvag_credit_entry WHERE wallet_id=?","i",array($wallet->id));$reserved=$this->db->one("SELECT COALESCE(SUM(amount),0) amount FROM davvag_credit_reservation WHERE wallet_id=? AND status='ACTIVE'","i",array($wallet->id));$expectedPosted=intval($posted->amount);$expectedReserved=intval($reserved->amount);return(object)array("walletId"=>intval($wallet->id),"stored"=>(object)array("posted"=>intval($wallet->posted_balance),"reserved"=>intval($wallet->reserved_balance),"available"=>intval($wallet->available_balance)),"ledger"=>(object)array("posted"=>$expectedPosted,"reserved"=>$expectedReserved,"available"=>$expectedPosted-$expectedReserved),"balanced"=>intval($wallet->posted_balance)===$expectedPosted&&intval($wallet->reserved_balance)===$expectedReserved&&intval($wallet->available_balance)===($expectedPosted-$expectedReserved));}
